OL,3,GNEWSAHop farm to cease production after
OL,4,Atwo hot summers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last commercial hop farm in Surrey
OL,7,Fhas said it is ceasing production after
OL,8,Fa second hot and dry summer devastated
OL,9,Fits harvest.
OL,11,FThe Hampton Estate, near Puttenham,
OL,12,Fsaid the lack of rain, on top of
OL,13,Feconomic pressures, had made growing
OL,14,Fthe crop unviable.
OL,16,FThe head of farming at the site, James
OL,17,FWindridge, said they harvested about
OL,18,F160 bales in 2024, dropping to about 50
OL,19,Fin 2025, and 30 this year.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
