OL,3,GNEWSAHop farm to cease production after
OL,4,Atwo hot summers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBill Biddell, the estate's chief
OL,7,Fexecutive, said: "This year has been an
OL,8,Fabsolute disaster, obviously because of
OL,9,Fthe weather."
